 "_source": "KiCad 10.0.6 kicad-cli pcb drc --severity-all on the pd_trigger route fixture (tests/fixtures/stages/pd_trigger/route), its .kicad_dru being base + a case's text + a newline, with drop's lines taken out, then CRLF line ends or a UTF-8 BOM where crlf or bom is set (board_edit renames a layer on the board). kicad is ok where DRC gave the base's violations and the case's own; void where KiCad applied none of the file's rules (50 or more violations, every one at a netclass, zone or board-setup value) and kicad-cli said nothing. unit_error: whether routelib.dru_unit_errors must find a value KiCad rejects (true), must find none (false), or need not judge (null): the file is void for another reason (a misspelled keyword, a bad condition, a type given twice) or for a value this reader does not follow (a % sign, a full-width digit). The e_ cases are issue 1309's; the rest are issue 1273's.",
 "base": "(version 1)\n# Generated by ai-ee rules_gen.py from constraints + jlc_capabilities.\n# Baseline (fab floor) first, per-net design rules last (later rule wins).\n(rule \"aiee_track_width_floor\"\n\t(constraint track_width (min 0.1524mm))\n\t(condition \"A.Type == 'track'\")\n)\n(rule \"aiee_clearance_floor\"\n\t(constraint clearance (min 0.1524mm))\n)\n(rule \"aiee_via_drill_floor\"\n\t(constraint hole_size (min 0.3000mm))\n\t(condition \"A.Type == 'via'\")\n)\n(rule \"aiee_via_diameter_floor\"\n\t(constraint via_diameter (min 0.6000mm))\n\t(condition \"A.Type == 'via'\")\n)\n(rule \"aiee_annular_floor\"\n\t(constraint annular_width (min 0.1500mm))\n\t(condition \"A.Type == 'via'\")\n)\n(rule \"aiee_edge_clearance_floor\"\n\t(constraint edge_clearance (min 0.3000mm))\n)\n(rule \"aiee_hole_to_hole_floor\"\n\t(constraint hole_to_hole (min 0.5000mm))\n)\n(rule \"aiee_silk_width_floor\"\n\t(constraint text_thickness (min 0.1500mm))\n\t(condition \"A.Type == 'text' && (A.Layer == 'F.Silkscreen' || A.Layer == 'B.Silkscreen')\")\n)\n# *:USB-C-SMD_MC-311D's own pads to its own NPTH pegs (#813): vendor geometry, reference/footprint_waivers.yaml\n(rule \"aiee_fpwaive_hole_clearance_USB_C_SMD_MC_311D\"\n\t(constraint hole_clearance (min 0.1800mm))\n\t(condition \"A.memberOfFootprint('*:USB-C-SMD_MC-311D') && B.memberOfFootprint('*:USB-C-SMD_MC-311D') && (A.Pad_Type == 'NPTH, mechanical' || B.Pad_Type == 'NPTH, mechanical')\")\n)\n(rule \"aiee_pwr_width_VBUS\"\n\t(constraint track_width (min 1.7500mm))\n\t(condition \"A.NetName == 'VBUS' && A.Type == 'track'\")\n)\n(rule \"aiee_pwr_width_VAUX\"\n\t(constraint track_width (min 0.2500mm))\n\t(condition \"A.NetName == '/VAUX' && A.Type == 'track'\")\n)\n(rule \"aiee_pwr_width_VIND\"\n\t(constraint track_width (min 0.0125mm))\n\t(condition \"A.NetName == '/VIND' && A.Type == 'track'\")\n)\n(rule \"aiee_pwr_width_VDD\"\n\t(constraint track_width (min 0.0050mm))\n\t(condition \"A.NetName == '/VDD' && A.Type == 'track'\")\n)\n",
